{# The type-information section, shared by every engine template that feeds #}
{# the decompiler type records. Parameterized by (findings list, heading #}
{# text) so each template passes its own heading text. The body is #}
{# verbatim-pinned by the section suite in src/lib.rs — wording or formatting #}
{# drift fails CI. #}
{% macro type_information_section(findings, heading) %}
{% if !findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

The following types were inferred by Ghidra's type database:

{% for ti in findings %}
- `{{ ti.name }}`: {% if ti.description.len() > 0 %}{{ ti.description }}{% else %}inferred type{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
